cal (4,196)\",4,196)]:\n    A=a+1;B=b+149\n    m=A/(A+B);pen=sf(.03,A,B)\n    print(f\"{name}: mean {m:.2%} P(>3%) {pen:.1%} E[cost] ${1.5e6*m+1e6*pen:,.0f} (defects ${1.5e6*m:,.0f} + penalty ${1e6*pen:,.0f})\")\nE"}}}
